<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Space Grotesk,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#fff">Welcome to <%= it.name %>, <%= it.firstName %></h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#B8C5DA">Your account is open. Fund it to start trading, or browse strategies while you decide — there's no rush.</p>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 22px">
  <tr><td style="background:#060C20;border:1px solid #1B2D5C;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px">
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E8FBF;font-weight:600">Next steps</p>
    <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#F6F8FF">
      1. Make a deposit from your dashboard<br>
      2. Open an investment plan or copy a trader<br>
      3. Track everything in your statement
    </p>
  </td></tr>
</table>

<a href="<%= it.base %>/dashboard" style="display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#3B7BFF 0%,#3B7BFF 55%,#F5B82E 100%);color:#080E26;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:9px">Go to dashboard</a>
